<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suppŏsĭtĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subp-</span></b> ),
			ōnis, f.
		suppono, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a putting</i> or <i>setting
			under.</i> * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ovorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 5, 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>a putting in the place of</i> another, <i>substitution</i> (of a child): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pueri, Plaut. Capt. grex 3: puellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Cist. 1, 3, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suppositionem facere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 2, 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Truc. 2, 4, 83</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
